expect +1 row
clean
shot project-landscape
tap More
tap Use portrait
wait-for Row 2
# Undo at row 0 and starting a section that is already at row 0 each say
# why nothing changed, rather than taking the tap silently.
tap Change section
wait-for Which section are you knitting?
tap Heel
wait-for Heel
expect Row 0
tap Undo
wait-for Already at row 0; nothing was undone.
tap Start section again
wait-for This section is already at row 0.
clean
shot project-nothing-to-undo
tap Change section
wait-for Which section are you knitting?
tap Leg
wait-for row 2 of 8
# The count, the section and the repeat length survive Needles closing.
restart
